'''Freeze Dummy''' (停止木人城, ''Teishi Mokujin-jō'', '''Freeze Wooden Castle''') is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in [[Arena of Power/Freeze in Fright|Freeze in Fright]]. It was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Freeze Dummy
|image = E 739.png
|appearance = [[Arena of Power/Freeze in Fright|Freeze in Fright]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
While this base resembles the original [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]], it isn't nearly as lethal. However, it has over double the range with a guaranteed Freeze and around 49% uptime.

==Strategy==
You almost certainly are not going to be able to outrange it, but its damage is low enough that most units won't be harmed. They will, however, be stuck in place for a little under half of their existence. Bring as many [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|Cats with Freeze Immunity]] as is reasonable, and otherwise focus on the enemy fighters rather than the base.

